SiliconForest
=============

This file covers the original SiliconForest code: the files in this repository
that were written for SiliconForest and are not ported, adopted or copied from
another project. That code is under the MIT License below.

It does not cover, and does not change the licence of, anything else in the
repository. Code ported from Linux and Asahi Linux stays GPL-2.0 (or
"GPL-2.0-only OR MIT" and similar where a file says so); the Chonkstep desktop
source and the patches derived from it stay GPL-3.0-only; files adopted from
Finch stay "MIT OR Apache-2.0"; OpenBSD-derived files stay ISC; patches to
Mozilla, darling-metal and other MPL-2.0 files stay MPL-2.0; patches to
PureDarwin and to Apple's open-source releases follow the file they change
(BSD-2-Clause, APSL-2.0 and others). The licence of a file is the one stated in
the file (its SPDX line and notices); where a file carries none, the NOTICE file
of its directory applies, then the top-level NOTICE. Copyright and licence
notices of other projects are never removed.

Where each licence's full text is: LICENSES/. Who made what: NOTICE.

A kernel collection or a system image built from this repository combines
programs under different licences. This file makes no statement about the
terms under which such a combined binary may be distributed.

